# Copywriting

- Product UI and marketing copy are **English only**.
- Hosting is **Vercel** (not Netlify).
- Before product / billing / integrations work, also read `docs/product-roadmap.md` and `docs/copywriting.md`.

## No dash punctuation in prose

Do **not** use hyphens or dashes as sentence punctuation (`-`, `–`, `—`) to join clauses or as decorative separators.

Prefer, depending on the sentence:

- **Colon** `:` to introduce or explain
- **Parentheses** `( )` for asides
- **Slash** `/` for short alternatives (Solo / Pro)
- **Pipe** `|` for compact UI labels (Easy Patch | Patch notes)
- **Middle dot** `·` for light inline lists or meta separators (Trial · Solo · Pro)

Compound technical tokens (OAuth, GitHub, IDs) stay as usual. Price strings may use `/` (e.g. `€4.99 / month`).

### Examples

```text
Bad:  Card required — no charge today
Good: Card required (no charge today)

Bad:  Trial then Solo - or Pro
Good: Trial then Solo / Pro

Bad:  Easy Patch — Patch notes
Good: Easy Patch | Patch notes

Good: Trial · 5 generations · card required
```
